 "summary": "A family of seven glass-passivated silicon rectifiers in the flat-lead SOD-123FL surface-mount package. Every type carries 1.0 A average and 25 A surge; they differ only in reverse voltage rating, from 50 V (SM4001PL) up to 1000 V (SM4007PL). Forward drop is at most 1.1 V at 1 A and leakage at most 10 µA at rated voltage and 25 °C. SM4007PL is the 1000 V type, marked A7.",
